    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "-\nI\nAIR\nPINE\nSEATTLE\nSAN. FRANCISCO\nLOS ANGELES\nJUNEAU\nFAIRBANKS\nANCHORAGE\nHONOLULU\nNOME\nSAMOA\nINTERNATIONAL\nDATE LINE\nAUCKLAND\nSUVA\n~\n-\nN\nWAKE\nGUAM\nSYDNEY\nMELBOURNE\nol\n1\nDARWIN\n• P\nTOKYO\nSHANGHAI\nHONG KONG\nMANILA\nPERTH\nCIFIC\nLINES\n•\nDC - 6\nEDMONTON\nDENVER\nPHOENIX\nWINNIPEG\nCHICAGO\nDALLAS\nNEW ORLEANS\nNEW YORK\nMIAMI\nHAVANA\nLIMA\nSLEEP\nP\n/\nBERMUDA\nBUENOS AIRES\nSANTIAGO\n3\n5\n6\n5\n6\n7\nHOUR\nCLOCK\nAM\nSE\nRIO DE JANEIRO\n8\nTIME\nAZORES\n10\n10\nDAKAR\nPAL\n11\n-\nINSTRUCTIONS\nON REVERSE SIDE\nZN\nLONDON\nG\nPARIS\nMADRID\nALGIERS\nAMSTERDAM\nTime Selector\n13\nSTOCKHOLM\nBERLIN\nGENEVA\nROME\nWd\n0г\n8\n8L\n9\nJOHANNESBURG\nHELSINKI\nLYDDA\nCAIRO\nMOSCOW\nDRAHRAN\nSINGAPORE\nDJAKARTA\nCALCUTTA\nKARACHI\nDELHI\nBOMBAY\nCOLOMBO\nTEHERAN\nBAKU\nINTER\nCHUNGKING\nSAIGON\nRANGOON\nBANGKOK\nORIENT - EUROPE\n•",
      "TO GAIN TIME, FLY BY\nPHILIPPInE AIR LInES\nin DC-6 pressurized cabin sleepers\nLONDON\n-*AMSTERDAM\nFOYNES\n3 PARIS\nGENEVA\n* ROME\nMADRID\nLYDDA\nOKINAWA\nKARACHI HONG KONG\nCALCUTTA\nBANGKOK MANILA\nSINGAPORES\nDIAKARTA\nTOKYO\nGUAM\nWAKE\nVANCOUVER\nWINNIPEG\nSEATTLE.\nPORTLAND,\nSAN FRANCISCO\nLOS*\nANGELES\nMONTREAL GANDER\n→ CHICAGO,\nNEW YORK\nWASHINGTON\nNEW\nMIAMI\nORLEANS • HAVANHA\nHONOLULU\nMEXICO CITY•\n→ CARACAS\nLINES\nALORES\nDARWIN\nLIMA •\nSANTIAGO L\nSYDNEY\nBELEM\nRIO DE\nJANEIRO\nBUENOS AIRES\nHOW TO USE YOUR TIME SELECTOR: Turn dial until present\nstandard time lines up with city in which you are located.\nStandard time in other cities is automatically indicated.\nAlways read clockwise. Deduct one day when passing\nthrough International Date Line. Add one hour for Daylight\nSaving Time. Remember that you move into the next\nday when passing through midnight."
